        ":question/id": "02a7c88a-89aa-556b-ba04-b88cc41c06d2",
        ":question/problem": "Let $a = ⟨ - 9, -4⟩$ and $b = ⟨11,13⟩$. Find $a - 2b$.",
        ":question/worked-solution": "To compute $a - 2b$, we just need to perform the required operations with each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\na - 2b &= ⟨-9,-4⟩ - 2\\cdot ⟨11,13⟩ \\\\\n&= ⟨-9,-4⟩ - ⟨22,26⟩ \\\\\n&= ⟨-9 - 22, -4 - 26⟩ \\\\\n&= ⟨-31,-30⟩\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"
      },
