        ":question/problem": "Let $a = ⟨1, 13⟩$ and $b = ⟨1,-15⟩$. Find $a - 3b$.",
        ":question/worked-solution": "To compute $a - 3b$, we just need to perform the required operations with each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\na - 3b &= ⟨1,13⟩ - 3\\cdot ⟨1,-15⟩ \\\\\n&= ⟨1,13⟩ - ⟨3,-45⟩ \\\\\n&= ⟨1 - 3, 13 - (-45)⟩ \\\\\n&= ⟨-2,58⟩\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"
